     44dp ripple and the 36dp buffering ring).
     THIS IS THE 24dp GEOMETRY AT A LARGER INTRINSIC SIZE, NOT NEW ARTWORK. Only android:width and
     android:height differ from the 24dp original; the viewport, pivots and every path string are
     byte-identical, because the viewport is the coordinate space and width/height is only the render
     size. That is why there are now THREE sets rather than two.
     Deliberate trade-off, accepted 2026-08-28: the 48dp set is independently drawn and OPTICALLY
     CORRECTED (thinner bars, different corner radii, a 960 viewport rather than 24) — this one is not,
     so its strokes are marginally heavier than a redrawn 32dp would be. Judged not visible at this
     size. If it ever needs correcting, redraw it against the 48dp set; do not rescale this one. -->
